parameters.help_en:
The ID of the model to use for correction.

The following models are available:

```json

[
                    {
                        "ModelName": "Custom Correction Model",
                        "ModelId": "qwen-custom-correction-v1"
                    },
                    {
                        "ModelName": "Essay Correction Model",
                        "ModelId": "qwen-correction-v1"
                    },
                    {
                        "ModelName": "Essay Correction Lite Model",
                        "ModelId": "qwen-correction-v1-lite"
                    }
                ]
```

